{
  "slug": "mongodb-atlas-online-archive",
  "concept": "MongoDB Atlas Online Archive",
  "generated": "2026-09-08",
  "summary": "Online Archive automatically moves documents matching an archival rule out of the live Atlas cluster into Atlas-managed object storage, while keeping those documents queryable through the cluster's FD",
  "facets": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Online Archive automatically moves documents matching an archival rule out of the live Atlas cluster into Atlas-managed object storage, while keeping those documents queryable through the cluster's FDI endpoint (transparent to the application).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Requirements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Dedicated cluster M10+ (not available on M0/Flex/Serverless)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#requirements",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "MongoDB 5.0+ on the source cluster",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#requirements",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "DATE (most common)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "dateFormat options: \"ISODATE\" (default ISODate), \"EPOCH_MILLISECONDS\", \"EPOCH_SECONDS\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#date-most-common",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Partition Fields Strategy",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Partition fields organize archived data into S3 prefix paths for efficient filtering. Critical for query performance. Choose fields commonly used in query filters:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#partition-fields-strategy",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Maximum 2 partition fields per archive rule",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#partition-fields-strategy",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "First field MUST match the dateField (for DATE criteria) or be the most selective filter field (for CUSTOM criteria)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#partition-fields-strategy",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Order matters: highest-selectivity filter field should be first",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#partition-fields-strategy",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Supported partition pruning operators: $eq, $gt, $lt, $gte, $lte, $ne, $in",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#partition-fields-strategy",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Fields NOT in partitionFields trigger full archive scan when queried",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#partition-fields-strategy",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Archive Job Timing & Processing",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Runs every 5 minutes",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-job-timing-processing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Max throughput: 2 GB per 5-minute interval",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-job-timing-processing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Max file size: 100 MB per archive file",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-job-timing-processing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Documents deleted from live cluster AFTER successful write to object storage",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-job-timing-processing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Schedule window: Archive jobs can be limited to off-hours to reduce production impact",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-job-timing-processing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Query Routing",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "When querying via the cluster's FDI endpoint:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#query-routing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Recent data → live cluster (fast, indexed)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#query-routing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Archived data → Online Archive object storage (slower, partition-based)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#query-routing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Combined queries → both, results merged transparently",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#query-routing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Applications do not need to change query patterns after data is archived - same connection string, same MQL.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#query-routing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Cost Model",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "$5/TB cost applies when QUERYING archived data. Storage itself is much cheaper than cluster storage (NVMe/GP3).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#cost-model",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Minimum: 10 MB per archive query (no benefit from very small queries).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#cost-model",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Restore / Rehydration",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Archive data is immutable (append-only). To restore to the live cluster:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#restore-rehydration",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Limitations",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "No updates/deletes on archived data: Archive is immutable object storage; updateMany or deleteMany against archived documents will not affect them",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#limitations",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "No Atlas Search on archived data: Full-text $search doesn't work on archived data",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#limitations",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "No indexes on archived data: All archived queries use partition pruning only",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#limitations",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "$sample not random: Returns first N documents, not a statistical random sample",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#limitations",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "No transactions crossing live+archive: Cannot span a transaction across live and archived documents",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#limitations",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Maximum query timeout: 6 hours (inherits from Data Federation limit)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#limitations",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Archive Not Moving Data",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Check Atlas → Online Archive → [collection] → Activity tab for job status and errors",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-not-moving-data",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify dateField name is exact (case-sensitive) and matches documents",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-not-moving-data",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Confirm correct dateFormat - ISODATE requires actual ISODate values, not Unix epoch integers",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-not-moving-data",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Confirm cluster tier is M10+ and MongoDB version 5.0+",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-not-moving-data",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Archive Backlog Growing",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Archive jobs process 2 GB per 5-minute window",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-backlog-growing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "If data accumulates faster than 2 GB/5 minutes, backlog will grow",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-backlog-growing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Mitigation: narrow the archive rule to reduce concurrent archiving volume, or contact MongoDB for higher throughput",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#archive-backlog-growing",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Slow Archive Queries",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Partition fields not aligned with query filter → full archive scan",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#slow-archive-queries",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Check partitionFields match the most common query filter fields",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#slow-archive-queries",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Run explain() on the FDI endpoint to check nPartitionsScanned",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#slow-archive-queries",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "MACC / Cost Tracking",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Archive storage costs appear on the Atlas invoice under Tools & Services → Online Archive. Query processing costs under Data Federation. Monitor in Atlas Billing → Current Invoice.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#macc-cost-tracking",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Anti-Patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Choosing partition fields that don't match query patterns: Full archive scan on every query → high $5/TB cost",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Using CUSTOM criteria without an index on the filter field: Archive job itself will do slow scans to find matching documents - add an index on filter fields",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Querying archived data without partition-aligned filters: Always include a partition field in $match when querying archive",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Expecting consistency between live and archive: Documents are copied to archive and then deleted from live - there is no transactional guarantee between the two",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Using Online Archive as a backup system: Archive only stores the final document state at archival time - not a substitute for backup snapshots with PITR",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-atlas-online-archive/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
